<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais sets First Steamship warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais sets First Steamship warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 15 million American-style call warrants on shares of First Steamship Ltd.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    NT$28	  PREMIUM	    18.80 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     NT$5.264     GEARING	    5.32X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.MAR.98    PAYDATE	    04.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG   LISTING DATE     TO BE DETERMINED</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE NT$28	  MIN EXER LOT     5,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     CASH SETTLEMENT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
